  {
    "gold": "94",
    "question": "The teacher told the class that if they averaged at least 75% on their final exam, they could have a pizza party. Everyone took the exam on Monday, except for William, who was allowed to take it on Tuesday. If there are 30 people in the class, and the average before he took the test was a 74%, what score does he have to get to make sure they get to have a pizza party?",
    "question_sha256": "d2024c94ed084a067a9761e81c47012fd0c931784f49c844f173531d1a9d77b5",
    "responses": [
      {
        "key": "gsm8k-train-1776:rich",
        "raw_call_sha256": "756b699ef1cb5299f975e0249b56cc0b3f28a89323584ecbfa5321dd97474c4a",
        "student_prefix": [
          {
            "content": "The teacher told the class that if they averaged at least 75% on their final exam, they could have a pizza party. Everyone took the exam on Monday, except for William, who was allowed to take it on Tuesday. If there are 30 people in the class, and the average before he took the test was a 74%, what score does he have to get to make sure they get to have a pizza party?",
            "role": "user"
          }
        ],
        "student_prefix_sha256": "5bdc6b1a4034d8848a6d0a793aff5a930508ff0c13c79ff36af7e09933647dfe",
        "target": "Given:\n- Class size: 30 students\n- Average score before William took the test: 74%\n- Required average to have a pizza party: 75%\n\nLet's denote William's score as \\( x \\).\n\nThe total score of the 29 students before William took the test is \\( 29 \\times 74 \\).\n\nThe new average after William takes the test should be 75%, so the total score of all 30 students should be \\( 30 \\times 75 \\).\n\nSetting up the equation:\n\\[ 29 \\times 74 + x = 30 \\times 75 \\]\n\nCalculating the left side:\n\\[ 29 \\times 74 = 2146 \\]\n\nCalculating the right side:\n\\[ 30 \\times 75 = 2250 \\]\n\nSo the equation becomes:\n\\[ 2146 + x = 2250 \\]\n\nSolving for \\( x \\):\n\\[ x = 2250 - 2146 \\]\n\\[ x = 104 \\]\n\nWilliam needs to score 104% to ensure the class average is 75%.\n\nFINAL: 104",
        "target_sha256": "d43b1631e13afc3d31a5d48b54407f0068d9838d5d4fdb2211086f960518618d"
      }
    ],
    "task_id": "gsm8k-train-1776"
  },
